    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dublin 8, voted by Time Out magazine as amongst the coolest neighbourhoods in the world. The Newmarket area continues to get better and better. Undergoing major redevelopment, this area is a must for savvy buyers. \r\nShort walk to all city centre amenities, St Stephens Green c.15 mins Camden Street c.10 mins. Array of local pubs, hotels and eateries on the doorstep. Adj to the Aloft Hotel and Teelings distillery.\r\nFirst floor apartment of c.52 sq.m overlooking the central courtyard. Designated car space in the gated car park. \r\nTurnkey condition, ready for immediate occupation.\r\nAccommodation comprises Entrance Hallway with storage, living room with juliet balconies overlooking the courtyard, two double bedrooms (one with juliet balcony), recently refurbished kitchen, recently refurbished fully tiled shower room. Very useful extra room, suitable for storage or use as a home offfice.\r\n\r\nInformation provided by Lorigan Auctioneers does not form any part of any offer or contract and is provided in good faith, for guidance only. We have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. Maps and plans are not to scale and measurements are approximate, photographs provided for guidance only. The particulars, descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and any other details, such as prices, rents or any other outgoings are for guidance only and may be subject to change. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of details provided to them either verbally or through advertising. We have no authority to make or give any representation or warranty in respect of this property."
